  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Mozambique Rapariga Biz</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Programme Mozambique Action for Girls and Young Women (Rapariga Biz) generates robust evidence through the implementation of interventions that help girls and young women make informed decisions about their sexual and reproductive health and rights. The programme aims at measurable change in the attitudes, behavior, and agency to reduce early marriage and pregnancy rates.</narrative>
  </description>
